      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>heat</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>CO</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>600</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8451;</mi></mrow></mover><mi>FeO</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>CO</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>700</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8451;</mi></mrow></mover><mi>Fe</mi></math>",
